📊 JSON vs YAML — When to Use What

Feature           | JSON                | YAML
------------------|---------------------|-------------------
APIs              | ✅ Best             | ❌ Rarely
AWS files         | ✅ Best             | ❌ Rarely
Kubernetes        | ❌ Rarely           | ✅ Best
Docker            | ❌ Rarely           | ✅ Best
CI/CD             | ❌ Rarely           | ✅ Best
Logs              | ✅ Best             | ❌ Rarely
Terraform state   | ✅ Best             | ❌ Rarely
Comments          | ❌ Not supported    | ✅ Supported
Readability       | ❌ Less readable    | ✅ More readable
